flowchart TD
  Up["hack up"] --> Inspect["Inspect installation"]
  Inspect --> Ready{"Ready?"}
  Ready -->|Yes| Start["Review project and start"]
  Ready -->|No| Offer{"Interactive and resumable?"}
  Offer -->|No| Refuse["Refuse with guidance"]
  Offer -->|Yes| Consent{"Accept pinned downloads?"}
  Consent -->|No| Refuse
  Consent -->|Yes| Setup["Verify and prepare files"]
  Setup -->|Success| Reinspect["Re-inspect installation"]
  Reinspect --> Installed{"Ready after setup?"}
  Installed -->|Yes| Start
  Installed -->|No| Refuse
  Setup -->|Failed or interrupted| Refuse
  class Start ok
  class Refuse fail
  class Setup live
  class Consent wait
